Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||07-18-2000||08:42 PM||||This is my lucky week..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I picked up a 85GT that  run's good for $100.00..  a steal..  <P>Todat I found a 84 coupe..  my queston is ...   will everything exchange as far as mechanical part's???<P>It's a standard..  and my 87 GT is a automatic..  will all the transmission stuff fit my 87??    Stearing column the same??  <P>Thank 's guy's and gal's for info...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>                  Steve 87GT<BR>                        85GT<BR>           and maybe..  84 coupe??<P>three day's ago i was a proud owner of 1 fiero.... NOW i almost have 3..  lol||||reg||6
