Z||000002||ChadMan||07-19-2000||09:21 AM||||87ECO5 recently transplanted an 84 steering column into his 87 Coupe - it bolted right up, but the wiring harness plugs were different and I think he had to do some wire cutting/patching to make the wipers work properly.<P>As for the tranny, I've heard people on this Forum say all Fieros used the identical THM-125 automatic transmission & hardware.  I personally have never owned an automatic Fiero, so I can't tell you anything from firsthand experience.||||reg||1
