Z||000005||87ECO5||08-31-2000||01:16 PM||||<B>1FieroGTRacingInc</B> - Did you ever get that steering column swapped in?<P>Mine was a pretty even (and easy) swap.  Both columns had delay wipers, tilt wheel and were made for standard shift.  The difference was that the '84 column had cruise, whereas my '87's column did not.  Interestingly enough, the only problem I had (and am still having) is that my wipers act strangely.  I have no intermittent wipers and the slow wiper speed stops working after 5 or 6 swipes.<P>Thanks go out to <B>fiero56</B> - he did the actual swap for me.  I just stood by and provided tools and moral support!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
